---
title: Página no encontrada | TecRural
description: La dirección que buscas no existe o ha cambiado. Vuelve al inicio o explora las soluciones de TecRural.
canonicalPath: /404.html
permalink: /404.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
robots: noindex, follow
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}
{% block styles %}
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/research.css">
  <style>
    .not-found{min-height:min(62vh,620px);display:grid;place-content:center;text-align:center;padding:48px 0}
    .not-found .eyebrow{justify-content:center}
    .not-found h1{font:800 clamp(36px,6vw,58px)/1.1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-2px;color:var(--forest);margin:14px 0}
    .not-found p{max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:17px}
    .not-found-actions{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:25px}
    @media(max-width:600px){.not-found{min-height:55vh;padding:36px 0}.not-found p{font-size:15px}.not-found-actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
  <section class="wrap not-found" aria-labelledby="not-found-title">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Error 404</div>
      <h1 id="not-found-title">Página no encontrada</h1>
      <p>La dirección que buscas no existe o ha cambiado.</p>
      <div class="not-found-actions">
        <a class="button button-dark" href="/">Volver al inicio</a>
        <a class="button button-light" href="/#soluciones">Ver soluciones</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
{% endblock %}
